@adminapi_url=https://localhost/adminapi
@adminapi_client=adminapi_client2
@adminapi_secret=adminapi_SECRET_2025_rftyguhijkotgyhuijok

### Register a new client
POST {{adminapi_url}}/connect/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

ClientId={{adminapi_client}}&ClientSecret={{adminapi_secret}}&DisplayName=Admin+API+{{adminapi_client}}

### Get a token
# @name tokenRequest
POST {{adminapi_url}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: basic {{adminapi_client}}:{{adminapi_secret}}

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=edfi_admin_api/full_access

###
@token={{tokenRequest.response.body.access_token}}

### Create vendor V3 - send twice to test duplicate-company rejection (ADMINAPI-1483: second call should return 400, "already exists")
POST {{adminapi_url}}/v3/vendors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "company": "Vendor Duplicate Test 2",
  "namespacePrefixes": "uri://ed-fi.org",
  "contactName": "David Jiménez",
  "contactEmailAddress": "david.jimenez@example.com"
}


### Create profile V3 - send twice to test duplicate-name rejection (reference: Profiles already enforce this; second call should return 400, "already exists")
POST {{adminapi_url}}/v3/profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "profileV3DuplicateTest",
  "definition": "<Profile name=\"profileV3DuplicateTest\"><Resource name=\"School\"><ReadContentType memberSelection=\"ExcludeOnly\"><Property name=\"NameOfInstitution\" /></ReadContentType></Resource></Profile>"
}


### Create claimset V3 - send twice to test duplicate-name rejection (reference: ClaimSets already enforce this; second call should return 400, "already exists")
POST {{adminapi_url}}/v3/claimSets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "ClaimSetDuplicateTest"
}


###
@dataStoreId=2


### Get vendors
GET {{adminapi_url}}/v3/vendors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Get claim sets
GET {{adminapi_url}}/v3/claimSets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Make a copy of a claimset
# @name copyClaimSet
POST {{adminapi_url}}/v3/claimSets/copy
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "originalId": 2,
  "name": "EdFiSandboxCopy"
}

### Create an Application - send twice to test duplicate (VendorId, ApplicationName) rejection (ADMINAPI-1483: second call should return 400, "already exists for this vendor")
# @name createApplication
POST {{adminapi_url}}/v3/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "applicationName": "Application Duplicate Test",
  "vendorId": 2,
  "claimSetName": "EdFiSandboxCopy",
  "educationOrganizationIds": [1],
  "dataStoreIds": [
    {{dataStoreId}}
  ]
}


### Get Applications
GET {{adminapi_url}}/v3/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Create ApiClient - send twice to test duplicate (ApplicationId, Name) rejection (ADMINAPI-1483: second call should return 400, "already exists for this application")
POST {{adminapi_url}}/v3/apiClients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "ApiClient1",
  "isApproved": true,
  "applicationId": 1,
  "dataStoreIds": [
    {{dataStoreId}}
  ]
}

